&lt;p&gt;Planning and scheduling tasks across our complex nanosatellite constellation and ground station network is critical to Spire’s business success. These tasks include radio communication between space and ground as well as orbital maneuvers&amp;nbsp;to hold positional goals, including converging on and holding multi-satellite formations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
